    "html": "<p>A battery supplies a current to a lightbulb during <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> seconds. The internal resistance of the battery is not negligible. What is the current in the lightbulb?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Total \\: power\\: supplied\\: to\\: the\\: lightbulb}{T \\times emf \\: of\\: the\\: battery}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Total \\: energy\\: supplied\\: to\\: the\\: lightbulb}{T \\times emf \\: of\\: the\\: battery}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Total \\: power\\: supplied\\: to\\: the\\: entire\\: circuit}{T \\times emf \\: of\\: the\\: battery}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Total \\: energy\\: supplied\\: to\\: the\\: entire\\: circuit}{T \\times emf \\: of\\: the\\: battery}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
